      "text": "Some unfortunate injury news for Cardiff this week with Scott Sio (facial fracture), James Botham (hand) and Ben Thomas (calf) all being ruled out.\nThomas in particular set for a few weeks on the sidelines, Sio has had successful surgery and CVZ is confident he'll be back soon.",
